a. There shall be sufficient pitch control authority to accelerate from 45 knots to the maximum level flight airspeed, and to decelerate back to 45 knots at constant altitude.
b. Sufficient pitch authority shall be available to maintain altitude if full power is applied at 45 knots and if minimum power is applied at maximum level flight airspeed.
